---
description: UX — flows, states, mobile, cognitive load
globs: DELNO-site-v23/**,delno-web/**,delno-widget/**
alwaysApply: false
---

- Design empty, loading, error, and success states for user-facing surfaces.
- Progressive disclosure over long static pages; one primary action per viewport.
- Mobile: touch targets, sticky CTAs must not hide widget or critical content (`docs/P1.5_MOBILE_PASS.md`).
- Run `break-ui` for adversarial content on changed layouts.
